Package: cori.data.ipeds
Type: Package
Title: Access and Analyze IPEDS Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("CORI", "Data", email = "data@ruralinnovation.us", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Access and analyze Integrated Postsecondary Education Data System (IPEDS)
    data covering institutional characteristics, degree completions, and graduation rates
    from 2010 to present. Provides tools to download source files from NCES, read
    processed data from S3 at both institution and county level, and analyze higher
    education trends across geographies.
